ion name must be \"solve\" and it takes a single argument \"case\". The case is a dict with \"matrix\" key and possibly \"_case_nonce\". We ignore extra keys.\n\nReturn value must be JSON-serializable (list of floats, list of floats, list of list of floats). That's fine.\n\nThus final answer: a JSON object with key \"implementation\" and value being the escaped source string.\n\nMake sure no extra text before/after.\n\nWe'll produce the response exactly as required."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1136,"completion_tokens":2060,"total_tokens":3196,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1024},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1817},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1024,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":112},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}